  "_comment_5": "",
  "_comment_6": "Imager workflow: the AstromechOS Imager (PC tool) can drop a",
  "_comment_7": "pre-filled hw_layout.json into the SD card's /boot partition.",
  "_comment_8": "firstboot_setup.sh step 4.5 prefers /boot/hw_layout.json over",
  "_comment_9": "a fresh I2C scan — useful for headless installs where the",
  "_comment_10": "Imager knows the hardware before the Pi has ever booted.",
  "_comment_11": "",
  "_comment_12": "On the running Pi the working file is master/config/hw_layout.json",
  "_comment_13": "(or slave/config/hw_layout.json) — gitignored, atomic-written.",

